    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-21258d7d-d874-474d-85e8-001d3010e852",
      "chapter_id": "ch-5f804ff4-6058-470e-928a-d9e314cc569b",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "sha256": "1e159e7c5a5225268aab364e95e0926700e43c30781b7eaa0fcd4237e9f1f38d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-33cc02cf-af60-4d82-aa03-034c3146dc2c",
      "chapter_id": "ch-4211d5d9-d041-4611-b4b9-e5eddd689fc7",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-e754f1a3-1d84-4240-a9de-c5fac568eb39",
      "chapter_id": "ch-32f53d76-d37b-400a-bb20-03f2fc944b9e",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-8e8a76b8-a7fa-4895-a593-6b99f955a710",
      "chapter_id": "ch-53174434-7b8f-4ef2-8f30-463933c98ffe",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
